# Design tokens

Follow `doc/design-tokens.md`.

- Colors, spacing, radii, typography, layout, motion → `useAnthraTheme()` / `src/design-system`.
- Do not hardcode new hex colors or page-local font scales in screens.
- Add new semantic roles to light + dark tokens together.
